msgstr "ພະຍາຍາມຢັ້ງຢືນໃບໜ້າ"

#: src/cli.py:26
msgid "Could not determine user, please use the --user flag"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດກໍານົດຜູ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້, ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ --user flag"

#: src/cli.py:31
msgid "Command line interface for Ubuntu Hello face authentication."
msgstr "ການໂຕ້ຕອບເສັ້ນຄໍາສັ່ງສໍາລັບການພິສູດຢືນຢັນໃບຫນ້າ Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/cli.py:35
msgid "command"
msgstr "ຄໍາສັ່ງ"

#: src/cli.py:35
msgid "arguments"
msgstr "ການໂຕ້ຖຽງ"

#: src/cli.py:36
msgid ""
"For support please visit\n"
"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello"
msgstr ""
"ສໍາລັບການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອກະລຸນາໄປຢ້ຽມຢາມ\n"
"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello"

#: src/cli.py:41
msgid ""
"The command option to execute, can be one of the following: add, clear, "
"config, disable, keyring, list, remove, snapshot, set, test or version."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ຈະປະຕິບັດ ສາມາດເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນລາຍການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້: add, clear, config, disable, "
"keyring, list, remove, snapshot, set, test ຫຼື version."

#: src/cli.py:48
msgid "Optional arguments for the add, disable, remove and set commands."
msgstr "ອາກິວເມັນທາງເລືອກສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ add, disable, remove ແລະ set."

#: src/cli.py:55
msgid "Set the user account to use."
msgstr "ກໍານົດບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້."

