#: src/recorders/video_capture.py:57
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello could not find a camera device at the path specified in the "
"config file."
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello ບໍ່ສາມາດຊອກຫາອຸປະກອນກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບຢູ່ໃນເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ config ໄດ້."

#: src/recorders/video_capture.py:58
msgid ""
"It is very likely that the path is not configured correctly, please edit the "
"'device_path' config value by running:"
msgstr ""
"ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ຫຼາຍທີ່ເສັ້ນທາງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, ກະລຸນາແກ້ໄຂຄ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ 'device_path' "
"ໂດຍການແລ່ນ:"

#: src/recorders/video_capture.py:118
msgid ""
"Failed to read camera specified in the 'device_path' config option, aborting"
msgstr "ລົ້ມເຫລວໃນການອ່ານກ້ອງຖ່າຍຮູບທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ 'device_path', ຍົກເລີກ"
